1. Edit A — quarantine on corrupt load (AC-78). In the `load_snapshot` function, the except block currently reads exactly:
```
 except (json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError) as exc:
     logger.warning("Corrupt snapshot at %s: %s", path, exc)
