```
Replace it with:
```
 except (json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError) as exc:
     quarantine = f"{path}.corrupt-{int(time.time())}"
     try:
         os.replace(path, quarantine)
         logger.warning(
             "Corrupt snapshot at %s quarantined to %s: %s",
             path, quarantine, exc,
